- On a cluster with the bundled store enabled, creating a new pipelines application requires no manual storage endpoint configuration and defaults to the bundled store.
- Explicitly configured customer-provided storage continues to be honored (no regression for connected environments).
- Pipelines runs complete with artifacts stored in the bundled store on a disconnected cluster.

