10	# Decomposition Summary — RHAISTRAT-9012: Bundle an S3-compatible object store for disconnected installs
11	
12	Triage: not below-threshold (multi-component scope with a genuine gating unknown) and
13	not docs-only (code changes in Platform Operator, pipelines, serving). Full decomposition.
14	
15	The strategy's central unknown is legal, not technical: MinIO is AGPL-3.0 and HLR-1
16	states the clearance "blocks all shipping work". The open question names a bounded
17	fallback (an Apache-2.0 alternative, e.g. SeaweedFS) that "restarts image
18	productization". This is modeled as one Investigation epic with two conditional
19	branches for the store productization chain; all other work is upstream-agnostic and
20	stays in the main plan.
