30	# Data Science Pipelines connection defaults for the bundled store
31	
32	## Description
33	
34	Makes Data Science Pipelines target the bundled S3-compatible store by default
35	when it is enabled through the Platform Operator, so pipeline artifact storage
36	works on disconnected clusters without manual endpoint configuration.
37	
38	## Scope
39	
40	- Default the pipelines artifact-storage connection to the bundled store when the
41	  store is enabled by the Platform Operator, requiring no manual endpoint or
42	  credential configuration.
43	- Preserve manual overrides: explicitly configured customer-provided storage
44	  continues to take precedence over the bundled default (connected environments
45	  are unchanged — replacing customer-provided S3 there is out of scope).
46	- Align with the Data Science Pipelines architecture context: the component
47	  already depends on S3-compatible object storage for artifacts; this work only
48	  changes default targeting, not the storage interface.
49	
50	## Acceptance Criteria
51	
52	- On a cluster with the bundled store enabled, creating a new pipelines
53	  application requires no manual storage endpoint configuration and defaults to
54	  the bundled store.
55	- Explicitly configured customer-provided storage continues to be honored (no
56	  regression for connected environments).
57	- Pipeline runs complete with artifacts stored in the bundled store on a
58	  disconnected cluster.
59	
60	## HLR Traceability
61	
62	- HLR-3 (P1): Data Science Pipelines connection defaults can target the bundled
63	  store without manual endpoint configuration.
