33	# Midstream repo onboarding for the Apache-2.0 fallback object store
34	
35	## Description
36	
37	Creates the midstream repository for the Apache-2.0 licensed fallback object
38	store under opendatahub-io so a productized, supported store image can be built
39	from source. Executed only if the legal clearance denies AGPL-3.0 redistribution
40	for MinIO; per the strategy's open question, this restarts image productization
41	with the fallback upstream. If MinIO is cleared instead, the MinIO branch
42	replaces this work.
