45	
46	- Confirm the specific Apache-2.0 fallback upstream (the strategy names
47	  SeaweedFS as the leading example, not a final selection) against the
48	  platform's S3-compatibility needs, and document the selection.
49	- Create the midstream repository for the selected fallback store under
50	  opendatahub-io, mirroring the selected upstream version.
51	- Establish branching and versioning conventions consistent with other midstream
52	  components.
53	
54	## Acceptance Criteria
