12	## Problem Statement
13	
14	Pipelines and model serving both require S3-compatible object storage, but
15	disconnected customers frequently have none. Field teams work around this by
16	installing upstream MinIO ad hoc — unsupported, unpatched, and invisible to the
17	platform. We want a supported, bundled S3-compatible store that administrators
