16	installing upstream MinIO ad hoc — unsupported, unpatched, and invisible to the
17	platform. We want a supported, bundled S3-compatible store that administrators
18	can enable for disconnected and PoC clusters. The leading candidate, MinIO, is
19	AGPL-3.0 licensed; redistribution terms must be cleared before any productization
20	work can ship, and the outcome may force a different upstream.
